OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 29 JAN
OL,4,G2145FThe Essay: On Disappointment
OL,5,     GRachel Cooke looks at the
OL,6,     Gdisappointments which seem to be
OL,7,     Gbuilt into political life and
OL,8,     Gaffectionately recalls her own
OL,9,     Gthwarted political efforts,
OL,10,     Gduring her student days.
OL,11,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,12,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,13,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,14,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,15,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,16,     Geverything in between.
OL,17,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,18,     GSoweto presents an optimistic
OL,19,     Gtrack from the British jazz soul
OL,20,     Gtrio The Peddlers.
